<section class="fragment-review-dimension" data-artifact="review-dimension" data-dimension="correctness" data-rev="2">
<style>
.fragment-review-dimension { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; color: #1a1a2e; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .fragment-review-dimension { color: #e8e8e8; } }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .fragment-review-dimension { color: #e8e8e8; }

.frd-filter-bar { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.frd-chip { padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #ccc; background: #f5f5f5; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; transition: background 0.15s; }
.frd-chip.active { background: #1a1a2e; color: #fff; border-color: #1a1a2e; }
.frd-chip[data-sev="low"] { border-color: #27ae60; color: #27ae60; }
.frd-chip[data-sev="low"].active { background: #27ae60; color: #fff; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  .frd-chip { background: #374151; border-color: #6b7280; color: #d1d5db; }
  .frd-chip.active { background: #6b7280; color: #fff; }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"] .frd-chip { background: #374151; border-color: #6b7280; color: #d1d5db; }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .frd-chip.active { background: #6b7280; color: #fff; }

.frd-finding { border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
.frd-finding-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 14px; cursor: pointer; background: #fafafa; }
.frd-finding-header:hover { background: #f0f0f0; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  .frd-finding { border-color: #374151; }
  .frd-finding-header { background: #1f2937; }
  .frd-finding-header:hover { background: #374151; }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"] .frd-finding { border-color: #374151; }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .frd-finding-header { background: #1f2937; }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .frd-finding-header:hover { background: #374151; }

.frd-sev-badge { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
.frd-sev-low  { background: #e8f8f0; color: #27ae60; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .frd-sev-low { background: #052e16; color: #86efac; } }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .frd-sev-low { background: #052e16; color: #86efac; }

.frd-badge-pre { display: inline-block; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; background: #e5e7eb; color: #6b7280; margin-left: 4px; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .frd-badge-pre { background: #374151; color: #9ca3af; } }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .frd-badge-pre { background: #374151; color: #9ca3af; }

.frd-finding-id { font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
.frd-finding-msg { font-size: 13px; color: #555; flex: 1; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .frd-finding-msg { color: #9ca3af; } }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .frd-finding-msg { color: #9ca3af; }
.frd-finding-status { font-size: 11px; color: #888; }
.frd-finding-body { padding: 12px 14px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; background: #fff; font-size: 13px; display: none; }
.frd-finding-body.open { display: block; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  .frd-finding-body { background: #111827; border-top-color: #374151; color: #d1d5db; }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"] .frd-finding-body { background: #111827; border-top-color: #374151; color: #d1d5db; }
.frd-finding-body code { background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 12px; }
.frd-finding-body pre { background: #111827; color: #f3f4f6; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 12px; margin: 6px 0 0; }
.frd-loc { font-size: 11px; color: #888; margin-top: 4px; }
.frd-fix { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px; background: #e8f4ff; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 3px solid #2980b9; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .frd-fix { background: #1e3a5f; border-left-color: #60a5fa; } }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .frd-fix { background: #1e3a5f; border-left-color: #60a5fa; }

.frd-clean-notice {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 6px;
  background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; color: #166534;
  font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .frd-clean-notice { background: #052e16; border-color: #15803d; color: #86efac; } }
:root[data-theme="dark"] .frd-clean-notice { background: #052e16; border-color: #15803d; color: #86efac; }

.frd-hidden { display: none !important; }
</style>

<div class="frd-filter-bar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Filter by severity">
  <button class="frd-chip active" data-filter="all">All (1)</button>
  <button class="frd-chip" data-sev="low" data-filter="low">LOW (1)</button>
</div>

<div class="frd-findings-list">

  <div class="frd-finding" data-sev="low">
    <div class="frd-finding-header" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false">
      <span class="frd-sev-badge frd-sev-low">LOW</span>
      <span class="frd-finding-id">CR-3</span>
      <span class="frd-badge-pre">pre-existing</span>
      <span class="frd-finding-msg">tagStates map precedence relies on second-pass overwrites</span>
      <span class="frd-finding-status">open</span>
    </div>
    <div class="frd-finding-body">
      <div class="frd-loc">ArticleListItem.kt:77-82 &middot; confidence: med &middot; surfaced: 2026-07-06 &middot; last seen: 2026-07-10</div>
      <p>Two-pass map build: <code>tags</code> seeded as absent, then <code>article.tags</code> overwrites to present. Correct today (article-has-tag wins). Subtle for future maintainers reversing loop order or adding a third source mid-loop. Not touched by the new delta.</p>
      <pre>val tagStates = remember(article.tagsString, tags) {
    val all = mutableMapOf&lt;String, Boolean&gt;()
    tags.forEach { all[it] = false }        // Pass 1: all absent
    article.tags.forEach { all[it] = true } // Pass 2: article-owned wins
    all
}</pre>
      <div class="frd-fix"><strong>Fix:</strong> Add comments above each pass documenting the intended precedence so the ordering is not accidentally reversed.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="frd-clean-notice">
  <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
    <path d="M5 8l2 2 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  </svg>
  New-delta scan clean — no correctness bugs in commits 2ff0200–249eb41 (transaction wrapping, write-count chunking, keyset cursor, stall-guard rewrite + backedUpAt stamping).
</div>

<script>
(function() {
  var section = document.currentScript.closest('.fragment-review-dimension');
  if (!section) section = document.querySelector('.fragment-review-dimension');

  // Toggle expand/collapse
  section.querySelectorAll('.frd-finding-header').forEach(function(h) {
    function toggle() {
      var body = h.nextElementSibling;
      var open = body.classList.toggle('open');
      h.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
    }
    h.addEventListener('click', toggle);
    h.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {
      if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); toggle(); }
    });
  });

  // Filter bar
  section.querySelectorAll('.frd-chip').forEach(function(btn) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', function() {
      section.querySelectorAll('.frd-chip').forEach(function(b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });
      btn.classList.add('active');
      var f = btn.dataset.filter;
      section.querySelectorAll('.frd-finding').forEach(function(card) {
        if (f === 'all' || card.dataset.sev === f) {
          card.classList.remove('frd-hidden');
        } else {
          card.classList.add('frd-hidden');
        }
      });
    });
  });

  window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('sdlc:fragment-ready', {
    detail: {
      name: 'review-dimension',
      artifact: 'review-dimension',
      dimension: 'correctness',
      counts: { findings: 1, blockers: 0 }
    }
  }));
})();
</script>
</section>
